@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Weather Station System

[*] --> Restart

state "Restart" as Restart
Restart : entry / system restarts from shut down condition
Restart : do / system begins running
Restart : exit / system is in running state

state "Running" as Running
Running : entry / system collects data when triggered by clock
Running : do / system prepares and sends out weather summary upon request
Running : do / system checks its own status and transmits the result upon request
Running : exit / system returns to running state after performing an activity

state "Configuration Mode" as ConfigurationMode
ConfigurationMode : entry / system enters configuration mode when changes or power-saving settings are required
ConfigurationMode : do / user configures system
ConfigurationMode : exit / system returns to running state after configuration is completed

state "Controlled Mode" as ControlledMode
ControlledMode : entry / system moves into controlled mode through remote control
ControlledMode : do / user controls system remotely
ControlledMode : exit / system returns to running state or shut down condition

Restart --> Running
Running --> ConfigurationMode : [configuration required]
ConfigurationMode --> Running : [configuration completed]
Running --> ControlledMode : [remote control enabled]

state "Shutdown" as Shutdown
Shutdown : entry / system receives shutdown command while running
Shutdown : do / system moves into shut down condition
Shutdown : exit / system is in shut down state

ControlledMode --> Shutdown : [shutdown command received]
Running --> Shutdown : [shutdown command received]

state "Data Collection" as DataCollection
DataCollection : entry / system collects data when triggered by clock while running
DataCollection : do / system prepares and sends out weather summary upon request
DataCollection : exit / system returns to running state after performing an activity

state "Summary Preparation" as SummaryPreparation
SummaryPreparation : entry / system prepares and sends out weather summary upon request
SummaryPreparation : do / system checks its own status and transmits the result upon request
SummaryPreparation : exit / system returns to running state after performing an activity

state "Status Checking" as StatusChecking
StatusChecking : entry / system checks its own status and transmits the result upon request
StatusChecking : do / system collects data when triggered by clock while running
StatusChecking : exit / system returns to running state after performing an activity

Running --> DataCollection
DataCollection --> Running : [data collection completed]
Running --> SummaryPreparation
SummaryPreparation --> Running : [summary preparation completed]
Running --> StatusChecking
StatusChecking --> Running : [status checking completed]

Shutdown --> [*]

@enduml
